    "title": "Dunkin' launches new Halloween-themed menu item - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brady Doran ,\n1 hours ago\n( WHTM )– Spooky season is upon us, and Dunkin’s limited-time Halloween drink hit locations around the country on Wednesday.\nAccording to Dunkin’, an all-new Halloween-themed drink, along with returning Halloween favorites, are coming to stores, in addition to a limited-edition merchandise drop.\nDunkin’ said the new drink, called the Candy Bar Signature Latte, features a blend of chocolate toffee, pretzel, and peanut butter flavors with espresso, topped with whipped cream and mocha drizzle, Dunkin’ said.\nReturning this year are the Spider donut and the Halloween MUNCHKINS Bucket.\nMcDonald’s Boo Buckets are back with a new lineup: When you can get yours The Spider Donut is a fan favorite, according to Dunkin’, and it will be accompanied by merchandise at select locations this year. Fans can purchase a Spider Donut Straw Buddy, Stay Spooky Crewnecks, a Giant Spide Plushie, and other Spider Donut Merch online and at select retailers.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to NewsNation.",
